<li>O. Russakovsky et al., "ImageNet large scale visual recognition challenge," <em>Int. J. Comput. Vis.</em>, vol. 115, pp. 211–252, 2015 — the dataset paper behind everything in Chapters 4–6; read it to understand what ImageNet pretraining actually transfers.</li>
